  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n (1)/(5)÷ (3)/(10) of (4)/(9)- (4)/(5)× 1 (1)/(9)÷ (8)/(15)+ (3)/(4) + (3)/(4)÷ (1)/(2) \n\n⇒ 1/5 ÷ 3/10 of 4/9 – 4/5 × 10/9 ÷ 8/15 + 3/4 + 3/4 ÷ 1/2\n\n⇒ 1/5 ÷ 2/15 – 4/5 × 10/9 ÷ 8/15 + 3/4 + 3/4 ÷ 1/2\n\n⇒ 1/5 × 15/2 – 4/5 × 10/9 ÷ 8/15 + 3/4 + 3/4 ÷ 1/2\n\n⇒ 3/2 – 4/5 × 10/9 ÷ 8/15 + 3/4 + 3/4 ÷ 1/2\n\n⇒ 3/2 – 4/5 × 10/9 × 15/8 + 3/4 + 3/4 ÷ 1/2\n\n⇒ 3/2 – 5/3 + 3/4 + 3/4 ÷ 1/2\n\n⇒ 3/2 – 5/3 + 3/4 + 3/4 × 2\n\n⇒ 3/2 – 5/3 + 3/4 + 3/2\n\n⇒ (18 – 20 + 9 + 18)/12\n\n⇒ (45 – 20)/12\n\n⇒ 25/12\n\n**∴ The required value is (25)/(12)**\n\n12",
